   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Happy multiethnic family sitting on sofa laughing together. Cheerful parents playing with their sons at home. Black father tickles his little boy while the mother and the brother smile.</rdf:li>
